# Call the local binary directly so `pnpm`'s verifyDepsBeforeRun cannot
# recreate node_modules mid-commit (pnpm 11 defaults that to "install").
#
# `--concurrent 1` because lint-staged otherwise chunks a large commit into
# seven parallel prettier+oxlint pairs, and fourteen concurrent node processes
# get the prettier ones SIGKILLed — which aborts the whole commit. Serial is a
# little slower on small commits and is the difference between working and not
# on large ones.
./node_modules/.bin/lint-staged --concurrent 1
